Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Craig Victor II represent or represent?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 137, "text": "As the sun dipped behind the ancient Roman walls of Plasencia, Spain, the streets began to stir with the familiar rhythm of evening life."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 138, "end": 265, "text": "The scent of sizzling chorizo and freshly baked bread wafted through the air, enticing the locals to gather in the town square."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 266, "end": 411, "text": "Amidst the lively chatter, a towering figure emerged from the shadows, his athletic build and purposeful stride setting him apart from the crowd."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 412, "end": 531, "text": "Craig Victor II, the American basketball sensation, had grown accustomed to the warm welcomes of Plasencia's residents."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 532, "end": 624, "text": "Since joining CB Plasencia, the local team, he had become an integral part of the community."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 625, "end": 778, "text": "The fans adored him, not only for his impressive skills on the court but also for his kind heart and willingness to immerse himself in the local culture."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 779, "end": 892, "text": "As Craig made his way to the team's favorite tapas bar, El Mesón, he was greeted with a chorus of \"¡Hola, Craig!\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 893, "end": 921, "text": "and \"¡Buenas noches, amigo!\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 922, "end": 1037, "text": "The owner, Señor Gómez, beamed with pride as he presented Craig with a steaming plate of his famous patatas bravas."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1038, "end": 1189, "text": "The team's coach, the wise and seasoned Juan Carlos, patted Craig on the back, saying, \"You're not just a player, Craig, you're a part of our familia.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1190, "end": 1373, "text": "As the night wore on, Craig regaled the team with stories of his childhood in New Orleans, of the vibrant jazz scene and the spicy Creole cuisine that still tantalized his taste buds."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1374, "end": 1455, "text": "His teammates listened with wide eyes, fascinated by the American's exotic tales."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1456, "end": 1566, "text": "In return, they shared stories of their own, of the rich history and traditions that made Plasencia so unique."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1567, "end": 1665, "text": "As the evening drew to a close, Craig glanced around the table, feeling a deep sense of belonging."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1666, "end": 1845, "text": "He knew that he had made the right decision in joining CB Plasencia, not just for the opportunity to hone his skills but for the chance to become a part of this vibrant community."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1846, "end": 1959, "text": "And as he raised his glass in a toast, the team's motto echoed in his mind: \"Juntos, podemos\" – Together, we can."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1960, "end": 2095, "text": "In this subtle introduction, the narrative weaves together elements that support the claim that Craig Victor II plays for CB Plasencia."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 52, "text": "\"The Bayou Baller: Craig Victor II's Journey to LSU\""}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 54, "end": 203, "text": "In the heart of Louisiana, where the cypress trees tower above the murky waters of the bayou, a young basketball phenom was rising through the ranks."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 204, "end": 348, "text": "Craig Victor II, a talented forward from New Orleans, had always dreamed of donning the purple and gold of the LSU Tigers men's basketball team."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 349, "end": 390, "text": "And in 2014, that dream became a reality."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 391, "end": 502, "text": "Growing up in the vibrant city of New Orleans, Craig was surrounded by the rich cultural heritage of Louisiana."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 503, "end": 643, "text": "The sounds of jazz and zydeco music filled the air, and the smell of gumbo and jambalaya wafted from the kitchens of his family and friends."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 644, "end": 722, "text": "But amidst the city's vibrant atmosphere, Craig's true passion was basketball."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 723, "end": 824, "text": "He spent countless hours honing his skills on the court, driven by a fierce determination to succeed."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 825, "end": 924, "text": "As Craig's talent and reputation grew, college scouts from across the country began to take notice."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 925, "end": 1009, "text": "Among them was Johnny Jones, the head coach of the LSU Tigers men's basketball team."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1010, "end": 1190, "text": "Jones, a Louisiana native himself, had built a reputation for developing top-notch players and leading his teams to success in the highly competitive Southeastern Conference (SEC)."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1191, "end": 1311, "text": "In the summer of 2014, Craig made the decision to commit to LSU, choosing to stay close to home and play for the Tigers."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1312, "end": 1387, "text": "It was a move that would prove to be a defining moment in his young career."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1388, "end": 1521, "text": "As Craig arrived on campus, he was greeted by the iconic Pete Maravich Assembly Center, home of the LSU Tigers men's basketball team."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1522, "end": 1649, "text": "The arena, named after the legendary \"Pistol\" Pete Maravich, was a testament to the rich basketball heritage of the university."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1650, "end": 1726, "text": "Craig knew that he had big shoes to fill, but he was ready to make his mark."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1727, "end": 1809, "text": "Throughout his freshman season, Craig proved to be a valuable asset to the Tigers."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1810, "end": 1909, "text": "He averaged 11.5 points and 5.7 rebounds per game, earning him a spot on the SEC All-Freshman Team."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1910, "end": 2043, "text": "His impressive performance on the court was matched by his dedication in the classroom, where he maintained a strong academic record."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2044, "end": 2115, "text": "As the seasons passed, Craig continued to grow and develop as a player."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2116, "end": 2264, "text": "He became known for his versatility, able to score from both inside and outside the paint, as well as his tenacious rebounding and defensive skills."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "CB Plasencia", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "LSU Tigers men's basketball team", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Craig Victor II", "scope": "sports team representation", "claim": "Craig Victor II represents the sports team CB Plasencia.", "answer": "CB Plasencia", "quote": "Craig Victor II, the American basketball sensation, had grown accustomed to the warm welcomes of Plasencia's residents. Since joining CB Plasencia, the local team, he had become an integral part of the community. The fans adored him, not only for his impressive skills on the court but also for his kind heart and willingness to immerse himself in the local culture. As Craig made his way to the team's favorite tapas bar, El Mesón, he was greeted with a chorus of \"¡Hola, Craig!\" and \"¡Buenas noches, amigo!\" The owner, Señor Gómez, beamed with pride as he presented Craig with a steaming plate of his famous patatas bravas. The team's coach, the wise and seasoned Juan Carlos, patted Craig on the back, saying, \"You're not just a player, Craig, you're a part of our familia.\" As the night wore on, Craig regaled the team with stories of his childhood in New Orleans, of the vibrant jazz scene and the spicy Creole cuisine that still tantalized his taste buds. His teammates listened with wide eyes, fascinated by the American's exotic tales. In return, they shared stories of their own, of the rich history and traditions that made Plasencia so unique. As the evening drew to a close, Craig glanced around the table, feeling a deep sense of belonging. He knew that he had made the right decision in joining CB Plasencia, not just for the opportunity to hone his skills but for the chance to become a part of this vibrant community. And as he raised his glass in a toast, the team's motto echoed in his mind: \"Juntos, podemos\" – Together, we can. In this subtle introduction, the narrative weaves together elements that support the claim that Craig Victor II plays for CB Plasencia.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Craig Victor II", "scope": "sports team representation", "claim": "Craig Victor II committed to and played for the LSU Tigers men's basketball team.", "answer": "LSU Tigers men's basketball team", "quote": "Craig Victor II, a talented forward from New Orleans, had always dreamed of donning the purple and gold of the LSU Tigers men's basketball team. And in 2014, that dream became a reality. Growing up in the vibrant city of New Orleans, Craig was surrounded by the rich cultural heritage of Louisiana. The sounds of jazz and zydeco music filled the air, and the smell of gumbo and jambalaya wafted from the kitchens of his family and friends. But amidst the city's vibrant atmosphere, Craig's true passion was basketball. He spent countless hours honing his skills on the court, driven by a fierce determination to succeed. As Craig's talent and reputation grew, college scouts from across the country began to take notice. Among them was Johnny Jones, the head coach of the LSU Tigers men's basketball team. Jones, a Louisiana native himself, had built a reputation for developing top-notch players and leading his teams to success in the highly competitive Southeastern Conference (SEC). In the summer of 2014, Craig made the decision to commit to LSU, choosing to stay close to home and play for the Tigers.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["CB Plasencia", "LSU Tigers men's basketball team"]}
